patchelf
------------------------------------------
PatchELF is a small utility to modify the dynamic linker and RPATH of ELF
executables.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20260320-2
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/NixOS/patchelf

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/NixOS/patchelf/archive/refs/tags/0.19.2.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack patchelf-0.19.2-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./patchelf-0.19.2-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/patchelf-0.19.2-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/patchelf-0.19.2-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(patchelf)
  /usr/bin/patchelf.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/patchelf.README
  /usr/share/doc/patchelf/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/patchelf/ChangeLog.md
  /usr/share/doc/patchelf/README.md
  /usr/share/man/man1/patchelf.1.gz
  /usr/share/zsh/site-functions/_patchelf

